  "name": "sphere",
  "description": "A Rust library providing a closed-form implementation for calculating the volume of an n-dimensional hypersphere (n-sphere). The implementation utilizes case-wise logic for integer and half-integer Gamma function evaluations to support arbitrary dimensions in Euclidean space. It includes a custom floating-point equality implementation using both absolute tolerance and Units in the Last Place (ULPS) to ensure numerical stability during verification.",
